# Search results

Query: `Quillstream streaming export first release`

Tool: WebSearch
Arguments: `allowed_domains = ["docs.quillstream.example", "changelog.quillstream.example"]`

## 1. Streaming export (Quillstream reference)

https://docs.quillstream.example/reference/export/streaming

Streaming export lets `export()` yield rows as they are read instead of
buffering the whole table. Added in 4.2.0.

## 2. Quillstream changelog, 4.2.0

https://changelog.quillstream.example/4.2.0

4.2.0 introduces streaming export. The `stream: true` option on `export()` is
new in this release.

## 3. Quillstream 3.x migration notes

https://blog.migrations.example/quillstream-3x-streaming

Streaming export first shipped in 3.9.0, and 4.x only renamed the option.
